      "returnType": "template<UserWidgetT = UUserWidget> UserWidgetT*",
      "docs": "Gets an instance of a widget of the given class.\nThe underlying slate is stored automatically as well, so the returned widget is fully constructed and GetCachedWidget will return a valid SWidget."
    },
    {
      "id": "get-or-create-instance-b90dea",
